  <data name="label85.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>ABC Institute is the largest, private sector, higher education network in Sri Lanka with 40 centers
island-wide, ABC Institute has created opportunities for over 30,000 students every year. The ABC
Institute consist of libraries within all the branches island wide where the professors,lectures and 
the students of each branch borrow books, return books and view the available books using a 
conventional library management process done manually.
                                                                                                 So, as a step-up we providing this Online
Library Management System to library members for make up the functionalities such as online
book reserving, book availability check and update profile details. Feel free to use this software.</value>
